              li.list-item Et reprehenderit fugit et unde voluptate

        .flex.flex-row.flex-wrap.items-start(class='min-[1023px]:h-[550px] max-[1022.98px]:mb-3')
          .flex-in-start.flex.order-2.justify-center.flex-col.items-start.w-full.h-full.pt-3(
            class='min-[1023px]:order-1 lg:w-[55%] min-[1023px]:p-[5px_45px]'
          )
            small.subtitle(class='bg-[#AEE6B9] p-[5px_11px_8px_10px]')
              span.uppercase.font-bold(class='text-[#024430] text-[12px] leading-[12px]') our story
            h3.title.mt-2.font-bold(class='lg:text-[32px] md:text-[25px] leading-[44px] text-[#024430]') We have a mission to help businesses grow the best with existing conditions
            p.text.mt-4.text-base(class='text-[#4e6770] font-[500]') Ea nostrum temporibus ex nulla totam qui galisum quae a adipisci modi. In exercitationem culpa sed blanditiis corrupti sit doloremque maxime eos iusto molestiae ex laborum nulla in quas dignissimos 33 dolorum quis. Est dolor autem et voluptate autem id enim optio vel incidunt alias.
          .flex-in-end.flex.order-1.relative.w-full(class='min-[1023px]:order-2 lg:w-[45%]')
            img.max-w-full.h-auto.object-cover.rounded-md(
              src='assets/images/about-1/service.png',
              class='w-[857px]',
              alt=''
            )
  +MainContainer
    p.text-header-6.font-bold.text-first-brand.mb-5 Our leadership team
    +Heading2('Meet the amazing team behind Iori').mb-10(class='lg:max-w-[557px] lg:mb-[52px]')
    .grid.grid-cols-1(class='gap-[30px] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4')
      +AmazingTeamMember('assets/images/homepage-11-person-1.png', 'Devon Lane', 'CEO', 'Sharing content online allows you to craft an online persona that reflects your personal values and professional skills. Even if you only use social media occasionally', '#', '#', '#')
      +AmazingTeamMember('assets/images/homepage-11-person-2.png', 'Jennie Tho', 'Finance Manager', 'Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit laborum — semper quis lectus.', '#', '#', '#')
      +AmazingTeamMember('assets/images/homepage-11-person-3.png', 'Symon Lesin', 'Technology Manager', 'In a professional context it often happens that private or corporate clientsorder a publication to publish news. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident.', '#', '#', '#')
    +MarketingExpertSection(class='mt-[71px] lg:mt-[142px] mb-[89px] lg:mb-[178px]')
    .grid.grid-cols-12.items-center(class='mb-[71px] lg:mb-[142px]')
      .col-span-12.mb-6(class='xl:col-span-5 xl:mb-0')
        +FlexCol.text-left(class='xl:max-w-[450px]')
          +ItemsCenter.gap-x-3.mb-2
            span.w-12.bg-first-brand(class='h-[1px]')
            span.font-medium.text-gray-400(class='text-[18px] leading-[18px]') Testimonials
          +Heading2('What our clients say about us').mb-6
          +TextBase('Access advanced order types including limit, market, stop limit and dollar cost averaging. Track your total asset holdings, values and equity over time. Monitor markets, manage your portfolio, and trade crypto on the go.')

      .col-span-12.relative(
        class="xl:col-span-7 before:w-full before:h-full before:absolute before:bg-contain before:right-4 before:z-[1] before:bg-no-repeat before:bg-[right_bottom_80px] before:bg-[url('" + bgTestimonials + "')]"
      )
        +FlexCol.gap-y-7.relative(class='z-[3]')
          .ml-0(class='sm:ml-5')
            +CardTestimonial('assets/images/homepage-11-avatar-1.png', 'Ralph Edwards', 'Bank of America', 5, 'Access the same project through five different dynamic views: a kanban board, Gantt chart, spreadsheet, calendar or simple task list.')
          .ml-0(class='sm:ml-24')
            +CardTestimonial('assets/images/homepage-11-avatar-2.png', 'Dianne Russell', 'Bank of America', 4, 'Access the same project through five different dynamic views: a kanban board, Gantt chart, spreadsheet, calendar or simple task list.')
          +CardTestimonial('assets/images/homepage-11-avatar-1.png', 'Ralph Edwards', 'Bank of America', 4, 'Access the same project through five different dynamic views: a kanban board, Gantt chart, spreadsheet, calendar or simple task list.')
    +BlogSection(class='mb-[75px]')
    +NewsletterSection02
